cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  mathlib-api: a Claude Code skill for designing Mathlib definitions and
  their API
message: >-
  If you use this skill, or a design workflow derived from it, please cite
  it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Su
    given-names: Hang Lu
    alias: homeowmorphism
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-8050-4164"
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code skill for designing definitions, and the API around them,
  intended for Mathlib. It excavates the precedent already sitting in
  Mathlib's git history, PR reviews, and Zulip threads, then demonstrates the
  result in compiling Lean code rather than asserting it in prose. Outputs a
  precedent dossier, the definition, the API surface, a contrasting-cases
  example sheet, and a PR justification.
keywords:
  - claude-code
  - agent-skill
  - lean4
  - mathlib
  - api-design
  - formalization
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://github.com/homeowmorphism/mathlib-api"
repository-code: "https://github.com/homeowmorphism/mathlib-api"
